{"product_id":"urban-outlaws","title":"Urban Outlaws","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet the Urban Outlaws: Jack, Charlie, Slink, Obi, and Wren. Five quick-thinking, super-skilled kids who live to right society's wrongs. From their bunker deep beneath the city of London, the Outlaws plan their missions, stealing money from the rich to give to those in need. But events spiral out of control when they accidently uncover the whereabouts of Proteus - a game-changing new quantum computer with the power to steal top-security secrets in a nanosecond. It's down to the guile, guts and gadget know-how of Jack and his team to carry out their greatest plan yet - and avert world domination. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:22 x 195  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Peter Jay Black \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781408863503 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Mass Market Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 315\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44806596821145,"sku":"15RD-4-9781408863503","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/7ca87ebe91ee0d9707b694bc176e67b6.jpg?v=1752150771","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/urban-outlaws","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}